        "外層 $\\sqrt{u}$，導數 $\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}$；裡層 $u = 3x + 1$，導數 3。",
        "$f'(x) = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{3x + 1}} \\cdot 3 = \\frac{3}{2\\sqrt{3x + 1}}$。",
        "代 $x = 1$：$\\sqrt{4} = 2$，$f'(1) = \\frac{3}{2 \\cdot 2} = \\frac{3}{4}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{3}{4}$",
      "claim": "D(sqrt(3x+1)) == 3/(2*sqrt(3x+1)) ;; D(sqrt(3x+1), 1) == 3/4"
    },
    {
      "title": "$\\sin^2 x$：外層是平方",
      "prompt": "$\\frac{d}{dx} \\sin^2 x$",
      "problemId": "der-039",
      "steps": [
        "$\\sin^2 x = (\\sin x)^2$，最後一步是平方。外層 $u^2$，裡層 $u = \\sin x$。",
        "外層微分：$2u = 2 \\sin x$。",
        "裡層微分：$(\\sin x)' = \\cos x$。",
        "相乘：$2 \\sin x \\cos x$（也可以寫成 $\\sin 2x$）。"
      ],
      "answer": "$2 \\sin x \\cos x$",
      "note": "比較 $\\sin(x^2)$：外層 $\\sin$、裡層 $x^2$，導數是 $2x \\cos(x^2)$。兩個完全不同。",
      "claim": "D(sin(x)^2) == 2*sin(x)*cos(x) ;; D(sin(x^2)) == 2x*cos(x^2)"
    }
